Subject: [PATCH] sgl-kernel: build and register the ngram speculative kernels on ROCm

`csrc/speculative/ngram_utils.cu` is in the CUDA and MUSA builds but not the
ROCm one, and `reconstruct_indices_from_tree_mask` is registered in
common_extension.cc and common_extension_musa.cc but not
common_extension_rocm.cc. So `--speculative-algorithm NGRAM` initialises, loads
weights, captures both the target and the target-verify CUDA graphs, and only
then dies on the first decode:

  AttributeError: '_OpNamespace' 'sgl_kernel' object has no attribute
    'reconstruct_indices_from_tree_mask'

The kernel itself is portable -- it compiles clean under hipcc for gfx1100 with
no source changes, so this is purely a missing build/registration entry rather
than a porting job.

Measured on 4x RX 7900 XT (gfx1100), Qwen3-Coder-30B-A3B-Instruct bf16, TP=4,
with --speculative-num-draft-tokens 8:

  edit/echo prompt      ~114 tok/s   (vs ~39 without)   ~2.9x
  novel generation      ~39 tok/s    (vs ~39 without)   neutral

which is the expected shape for n-gram speculation: it pays on repeated or
lightly-edited context and costs nothing on fresh generation.

diff --git a/python/sglang/kernels/aot/csrc/common_extension_rocm.cc b/python/sglang/kernels/aot/csrc/common_extension_rocm.cc
index c204b415ce..34ce63dd7f 100644
--- a/python/sglang/kernels/aot/csrc/common_extension_rocm.cc
+++ b/python/sglang/kernels/aot/csrc/common_extension_rocm.cc
@@ -134,6 +134,12 @@ TORCH_LIBRARY_EXPAND(sgl_kernel, m) {
   m.def("qr_max_size", &qr_max_size);
 #endif  // !SGL_IS_RDNA
 
+  m.def(
+      "reconstruct_indices_from_tree_mask(Tensor tree_mask, Tensor verified_seq_len, Tensor positions, "
+      "Tensor retrive_index, Tensor retrive_next_token, Tensor retrive_next_sibling, "
+      "int batch_size, int draft_token_num) -> ()");
+  m.impl("reconstruct_indices_from_tree_mask", torch::kCUDA, &reconstruct_indices_from_tree_mask);
+
   /*
    * From csrc/moe
    */
diff --git a/python/sglang/kernels/aot/setup_rocm.py b/python/sglang/kernels/aot/setup_rocm.py
index 56c753ac07..edab3996c8 100644
--- a/python/sglang/kernels/aot/setup_rocm.py
+++ b/python/sglang/kernels/aot/setup_rocm.py
@@ -56,6 +56,7 @@ sources = [
     "csrc/moe/moe_topk_softmax_kernels.cu",
     "csrc/moe/moe_topk_sigmoid_kernels.cu",
     "csrc/speculative/eagle_utils.cu",
+    "csrc/speculative/ngram_utils.cu",
     "csrc/kvcacheio/transfer.cu",
     "csrc/memory/weak_ref_tensor.cpp",
     "csrc/elementwise/pos_enc.cu",
